    62                          ;; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
    63                          ;; The following routines are common to native code and bytecode interpretation.
    64                          ;; They are annotated with (sort of!) Hoare Triples to highlight which
    65                          ;; conditions must be met at entry and which will stand at exit (beware of Y<>0,
    66                          ;; see the comment at caml_init in loader.asm).
    67                          ;; Annotations refer to native code (caml_INTERP=<undef>).
